      "text": "-Distribute incoming traffic\nacroos multiple servers\n- key to scalability",
      "fontSize": 16.97164378820882,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-Distribute incoming traffic\nacroos multiple servers\n- key to scalability",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "w6kAvWDE8_O3mZwZv_U0u",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -118.15041692936006,
      "y": 1100.697293654389,
      "width": 413.08013485487965,
      "height": 392.1882212242472,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 555922710,
      "version": 1550,
      "versionNonce": 1427799574,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "bMYbURBsWie8BUk3YZ2zx",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1739888136233,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Routing algo=> Detemines how it \n    distributes the incoming reqs\n    to BE servers\n\n    Round robin: rotates reqs evenly\n                    across all servers\n    Least connnections: sends reqs\n                     to the server with fewest \n                     connections\n    IP hash:  routes based on IP,\n                ensuring the same IP gets \n                the same server for each req\n2)  Layer-> in which LB operates\n    * Layer 4: Transport Layer (e.g. TCP)\n    * Layer 7: Application Layer(e.g. HTTPS)\n                Routes based on content like url\n                and HTTP headers.",
      "fontSize": 18.45591629290574,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Routing algo=> Detemines how it \n    distributes the incoming reqs\n    to BE servers\n\n    Round robin: rotates reqs evenly\n                    across all servers\n    Least connnections: sends reqs\n                     to the server with fewest \n                     connections\n    IP hash:  routes based on IP,\n                ensuring the same IP gets \n                the same server for each req\n2)  Layer-> in which LB operates\n    * Layer 4: Transport Layer (e.g. TCP)\n    * Layer 7: Application Layer(e.g. HTTPS)\n                Routes based on content like url\n                and HTTP headers.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
