      "text": "Routing algo: Round robin ( its simple\nservices are stateless, no need for\npersisitent connections\nType: Layer 7 (application)\n- can make content- based routing\ndecisions for feature rolllouts\n- can control complex traffic\nmanagement as sys scales",
