      "text": "- increase no of servers\n- no of DBs\n- separate read and write servers\n    due to huge difference in read/ vs write traffic\n- User sharded counters to count milions\n    of likes/dislikes\n- users nearest to edge serv ers get the updated \n    count frequently on a specific tweet",
